1
00:00:03,209 --> 00:00:08,687
Each list shows its file name, country, status, how many records were imported,

2
00:00:08,687 --> 00:00:12,619
how many were rejected, and when it was last processed.

3
00:00:13,164 --> 00:00:16,065
Completed means every row was imported.

4
00:00:16,065 --> 00:00:21,288
Completed with errors means the list finished, but some rows were rejected.

5
00:00:21,288 --> 00:00:26,704
A list that is still importing, paused or failed is not used for checking yet.

6
00:00:27,156 --> 00:00:29,716
Open the Actions menu of a list.

7
00:00:29,716 --> 00:00:35,846
Download errors gives you the rejected rows, with the reason for each, as a CSV file.

8
00:00:36,304 --> 00:00:41,147
A list that is pending, paused, failed or importing has more actions.

9
00:00:41,147 --> 00:00:46,637
Process now starts or continues a list without waiting for the background task,

10
00:00:46,637 --> 00:00:50,124
and Pause import stops a list that is importing.

11
00:00:50,587 --> 00:00:54,807
Delete removes the list and all its phone numbers in the background.

12
00:00:55,288 --> 00:00:59,641
To replace a list each month, upload the new file first, wait until

13
00:00:59,641 --> 00:01:02,741
it is completed, and then delete the old list.

14
00:01:02,741 --> 00:01:06,378
That way your numbers are never unprotected in between.

